            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EZK.1.15+EZK.1.16+EZK.1.17+EZK.1.18+EZK.1.19+EZK.1.20+EZK.1.21"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ezek 1.15-21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Maze ndebye mbona inziga enye ziri iruhande rw'abakerubi, uruziga rumwe ruri iruhande rw'umukerubi, urundi ruziga ruri iruhande rw'undi mukerubi, kandi izo nziga zasaga na tarushishi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi uko zari zimeze uko ari enye zarasaga, bimeze nk'aho uruziga rumwe runyura mu rundi ruziga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iyo zagendaga, zagendaga mu mpande zazo enye zikagenda zitagoragora, ahubwo aho umutwe wabaga werekeye ni ho zaromborezaga, zikagenda zitagoragora. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "REV.4.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ibyah 4.8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Umubiri wabo wose n'imigongo yabo, n'amaboko yabo, n'amababa yabo, n'inziga bari bafite uko ari bane byari bifite amaso impande zose, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 10:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "izo nziga uko nabyumvise zitwaga inziga zikaraga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.10.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.10.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
